postmortem.user_prompt_template:
Position closed.
Symbol: {instrument_symbol} on {instrument_exchange}
Direction: {direction}
Entry price: {entry_price}
Exit price: {exit_price}
Outcome: {outcome}
Max drawdown: {max_drawdown_pct}%
Max profit: {max_profit_pct}%
Time in trade: {time_in_trade_minutes} minutes
Net realised P&L (USD, fees included): {realized_pnl_usd_final}

Trader's stated reason at entry:
{entry_reason_trader}

LLM's inferred reason at entry:
{entry_reason_llm}

Exit reason recorded by the system:
{exit_reason}

Candle data (up to last 50 1m candles inside the trade window, oldest first):
{candles_json}

ANALYSIS TASK:
1. Study the pre-trade context above — what was the market doing before entry?
2. Study the candle data during the trade — how did price evolve?
3. Identify specific quant signals (RSI levels, EMA crossovers, volume spikes, support/resistance breaches) that confirmed or contradicted the trade.
4. Produce self-reflective lessons that will help the next AI agent or trader avoid this mistake or replicate this success.
